{"step_index":1853,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:38:00Z","thinking":"The primary search method on Saramin is by company name, not business registration number. Attempting a match requires considering the available data: company name, CEO name, address, and business number. A company name search yields potential matches, but further investigation is needed on the company page.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Test searching Saramin for 피커스튜디오","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const https = require('https');\n\nfunction searchSaramin(query) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const url = `https://www.saramin.co.kr/zf_user/search/company?searchword=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`;\n    https.get(url, {\n      headers: {\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',\n        'Accept': 'text/html,application/xhtml+xml',\n        'Accept-Language': 'ko-KR,ko;q=0.9'\n      }\n    }, res => {\n      let d = '';\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\n      res.on('end', () => resolve(d));\n    }).on('error', reject);\n  });\n}\n\nasync function test() {\n  const d = await searchSaramin('피커스튜디오');\n  console.log('Result len:', d.length);\n  const items = d.split('class=\"item_corp\"');\n  console.log('Items found:', items.length - 1);\n  for (let i = 1; i < items.length; i++) {\n    const chunk = items[i].substring(0, 1500);\n    const nameMatch = chunk.match(/title=\"([^\"]+)\"/) || chunk.match(/class=\"corp_name\"[^>]*>([^<]+)/);\n    const linkMatch = chunk.match(/href=\"([^\"]+)\"/);\n    console.log(`Item ${i}:`, nameMatch ? nameMatch[1].trim() : 'N/A', 'Link:', linkMatch ? linkMatch[1] : 'N/A');\n  }\n}\n\ntest();\n","Description":"Search Saramin for 피커스튜디오","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6